  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "🆕 **Additions**\n- Added core middleware abstractions — `IMiddleware`, `MiddlewareContext`, and `MiddlewareItems`.\n- Added `MiddlewareChain` and its builder.\n- Added `InvocationMode` enum.\n- Added `InvocationContext`.\n- Added middleware chain-semantics and registration-order unit tests.\n\n⚙️ **Modifications**\n- Granted `InternalsVisibleTo` for the Specializations and Tests projects.\n- Restored `ProcessInvocationContext.Result` and the original class documentation (revert).\n- Specified explicit created types in middleware builders; cleaned up unnecessary `using` statements.\n\n🐛 **Bug Fixes**\n- Shared `Result` state across `InvocationContext.WithConfiguration` derivations.\n- Documented the `PipedProcessResult` disposal requirement in validation exceptions.\n- Fixed the shared-items test to verify cross-context sharing; skipped empty PATH entries in the pwsh resolver helper.",
